    "closed_rows": {
      "540": "The clone uses the shared Ninja node and state pointers, and the relocated status, packet and compiler startup functions retain their original addresses. The sound names and scalar pool stay linked in the folded owner.",
      "3965": "The folded native factory covers all six specified variants and the default. Its seven destructors, switch table and weapon vtables expand to the original ranges in the current unit.",
      "4030": "The common container owns render, const vfunc_79 and the original melee test virtual. The shared CameraDistanceFade is asserted at 0x340. The old standalone helper declarations are retired.",
      "4158": "The weapon constructors install the original hit and wall callbacks and seed their descriptor values. Action 447 and the two item effect callers pass real position pointers. The native vfunc_57 and the inherited destructor and descriptor dispatch survive in the folded owner.",
      "4160": "The common weapon class keeps its native initialization, descriptor writes, marker dispatch, attack-state test and draw methods. The original three-float display offset remains compiler-owned at its retail address.",
      "4224": "The native weapon overrides vfunc_57, the descriptor initializer and the Vec-taking vfunc_62. Its shared base and typed node array cover the original class fields, including the region beginning at 0x20C."
    },
